  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Ugh... Gahh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Those sick bastards! I can't believe they, they...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Those beasts...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Were they Reunion's doing...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Reunion enslaved infected beasts to use as troops...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "No, it's not that simple.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "I can feel it, they...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Are no mere beasts. In fact, they're more like us...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Instructor Dobermann...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Boss... What should we do?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Give them a merciful end.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Boss...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Dobermann, the battle is over.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "We also had to face off against Reunion forces.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "The Catastrophe is already looming over us. It's likely to break at any moment.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Even Chernobog will be reduced to rubble under its direct impact.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Reunion is taking advantage of this to sow even more chaos.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Dobermann, we're out of time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "We might be able to outmaneuver Reunion or stay concealed from Ursus, but we're powerless in the face of a Catastrophe.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "That's enough. Let's go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "No matter how reckless Reunion's plans are, the most important thing for us...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...is everyone's safety.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "That's right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Reunion's leaders may see this event as a sign, or even as a means...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "But for me, it signifies that we will be in greater danger from now on.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Choosing a time like this to incite chaos...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Reunion is either insane, or just evil.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Perhaps, a bit of both.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
